From: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: msc313: MStar internal Ethernet PHY

The 10/100 PHY integrated in the MStar/SigmaStar Armv7 SoCs, beside the EMAC.

Origin: https://github.com/linux-chenxing/linux.git mstar_v6_5_rebase 5de660288cdf709dd40882bc57170f81ab744dea
  drivers/net/phy/msc313.c
  drivers/net/phy/msc313.h
License: GPL-2.0-only
---
 drivers/net/phy/Kconfig  |   3 +
 drivers/net/phy/Makefile |   1 +
 drivers/net/phy/msc313.c | 203 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/net/phy/msc313.h |  47 +++++++++
 4 files changed, 254 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/net/phy/msc313.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/net/phy/msc313.h

diff --git a/drivers/net/phy/Kconfig b/drivers/net/phy/Kconfig
